    "parsed_response": {
      "turns": [
        {
          "speaker": "EMPLOYEE",
          "text": "Good morning, Helen Clarke. You're speaking with Daniel Reed. We can work through this over the telephone. Before we discuss your account, may I take your identification details?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "CLIENT",
          "text": "Good morning, Daniel. I have them here. [[EV_011]] [[EV_013]] [[EV_012]]"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "EMPLOYEE",
          "text": "Thank you. Before we turn to the discussion, is there anything about the way we handle your account correspondence that you would like to mention?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "CLIENT",
          "text": "Please keep the covering messages concise. I read the documents, but lengthy introductory emails make it harder to find what needs my attention. Clear headings are particularly helpful."
        },
        {
          "speaker": "EMPLOYEE",
          "text": "I can note that preference for covering correspondence. The formal documents would remain separate from any brief accompanying message."
        },
        {
          "speaker": "CLIENT",
          "text": "That distinction is helpful. I keep my own files, and I prefer not to search through conversational messages when I am organising them. [[EV_014]] [[EV_018]]"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "EMPLOYEE",
          "text": "Let me cover the relevant points directly. [[EV_001]] [[EV_002]]"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "CLIENT",
          "text": "[[EV_003]]"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "EMPLOYEE",
          "text": "[[EV_004]] [[EV_005]]"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "CLIENT",
          "text": "[[EV_006]]"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "EMPLOYEE",
          "text": "[[EV_010]]"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "CLIENT",
          "text": "I need a moment before we continue. Let me collect my thoughts."
        },
        {
          "speaker": "EMPLOYEE",
          "text": "Take your time. [[EV_007]]"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "CLIENT",
          "text": "I have my notes in front of me now. [[EV_015]] [[EV_016]] [[EV_017]] [[EV_019]]"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "EMPLOYEE",
          "text": "[[EV_008]]"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "CLIENT",
          "text": "[[EV_009]]"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "EMPLOYEE",
          "text": "Thank you. That concludes the instruction discussion. Is there anything else about telephone servicing or the account correspondence you would like to raise before we finish?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "CLIENT",
          "text": "Nothing else today. Telephone servicing is convenient when I have my papers beside me. I prefer being able to speak to someone without making a special journey."
        },
        {
          "speaker": "EMPLOYEE",
          "text": "Thank you for letting me know. Your preference for concise covering messages is noted. Thank you for your time today, Helen."
        },
        {
          "speaker": "CLIENT",
          "text": "Thank you, Daniel. Goodbye."
